abstract: >-
  Handwritten lecture notes and Jupyter notebooks for the Bayesian Modelling
  course of the Doctorado en Inteligencia Artificial (Chile), from set theory
  and probability to Kalman filters, Gaussian processes, MCMC, variational
  inference and hierarchical models.
